{"v":1,"book":"Jer","ch":48,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Concerning Moab: Thus says Jehovah of hosts, the God of Israel: Woe to Nebo, for it is destroyed; Kiriathaim is put to shame; it is captured; The lofty retreat is put to shame and dismayed.","tok":[{"t":"Concerning "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[0]},{"t":": Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[4]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":": "},{"t":"Woe","s":["H1945"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Nebo","s":["H5015"],"a":[9]},{"t":", for it is "},{"t":"destroyed","s":["H7703"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Kiriathaim","s":["H7156"],"a":[14]},{"t":" is put to shame; it is captured; The lofty retreat is put to shame and "},{"t":"dismayed","s":["H2865"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"The praise of Moab is no more; In Heshbon they have devised evil against her, saying: Come and let us cut her off from being a nation. You also, O Madmen, will be brought to silence; A sword will go after you.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"praise","s":["H8416"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is no more; In "},{"t":"Heshbon","s":["H2809"],"a":[4]},{"t":" they have "},{"t":"devised","s":["H2803"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7451"],"a":[7]},{"t":" against her, saying: "},{"t":"Come","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" and let us cut her "},{"t":"off","s":["H3772"],"a":[9]},{"t":" from being a "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[10]},{"t":". You also, O "},{"t":"Madmen","s":["H4086"],"a":[12]},{"t":", will be brought to silence; A "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[16]},{"t":" will go after "},{"t":"you","s":["H0310"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The sound of a cry from Horonaim, Desolation and great destruction!","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"sound","s":["H6963"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"cry","s":["H6818"],"a":[1]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Horonaim","s":["H2773"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Desolation","s":["H7701"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"great","s":["H1419"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7667"],"a":[4]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":4,"text":"Moab is destroyed; Her young have caused a cry to be heard.","tok":[{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"destroyed","s":["H7665"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; Her young have caused a "},{"t":"cry","s":["H2201"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to be "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[2]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"For by the ascent of Luhith Continual weeping will go up; For by the descent of Horonaim They have heard the distress of the cry of destruction.","tok":[{"t":"For by the "},{"t":"ascent","s":["H4608"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Luhith","s":["H3872"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Continual","s":["H1065"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"weeping","s":["H1065"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will go "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; For by the "},{"t":"descent","s":["H4174"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Horonaim","s":["H2773"],"a":[8]},{"t":" They have "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[12]},{"t":" the distress of the "},{"t":"cry","s":["H6818"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"destruction","s":["H7667"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"Flee, save your life, And be like a shrub in the wilderness.","tok":[{"t":"Flee","s":["H5127"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"save","s":["H4422"],"a":[1]},{"t":" your life, And "},{"t":"be","s":["H1961"],"a":[3]},{"t":" like a shrub in the "},{"t":"wilderness","s":["H4057"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"For because of your trust in your works and in your treasures, You also will be captured; And Chemosh will go forth into exile; His priests and his princes together.","tok":[{"t":"For because of your "},{"t":"trust","s":["H0982"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in your "},{"t":"works","s":["H4639"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and in your "},{"t":"treasures","s":["H0214"],"a":[4]},{"t":", You also will be captured; And "},{"t":"Chemosh","s":["H3645"],"a":[9]},{"t":" will go "},{"t"