erefore his taste remains in him, And his scent is not changed.","tok":[{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" has been at "},{"t":"ease","s":["H7599"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from his "},{"t":"youth","s":["H5271"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; And he is "},{"t":"settled","s":["H8252"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on his "},{"t":"lees","s":["H8105"],"a":[6]},{"t":" And has not been "},{"t":"emptied","s":["H7324"],"a":[8]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"vessel","s":["H3627"],"a":[9]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"vessel","s":["H3627"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; Nor has he "},{"t":"gone","s":["H1980"],"a":[14]},{"t":" into exile. Therefore his "},{"t":"taste","s":["H2940"],"a":[18]},{"t":" "},{"t":"remains","s":["H5975"],"a":[17]},{"t":" in him, And his "},{"t":"scent","s":["H7381"],"a":[20]},{"t":" is not "},{"t":"changed","s":["H4171"],"a":[22]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"Therefore indeed, days are coming, declares Jehovah, when I will send pourers to him, and they will pour him out and empty his vessels and shatter his jars.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore indeed, "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[2]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"declares","s":["H5002"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":", when I will "},{"t":"send","s":["H7971"],"a":[6]},{"t":" pourers to him, and they will pour him out and "},{"t":"empty","s":["H7324"],"a":[11]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"vessels","s":["H3627"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and shatter his jars."}]},{"n":13,"text":"And Moab will be ashamed of Chemosh, as the house of Israel was ashamed of Bethel, their confidence.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"ashamed","s":["H0954"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Chemosh","s":["H3645"],"a":[2]},{"t":", as the "},{"t":"house","s":["H1004"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":" was "},{"t":"ashamed","s":["H0954"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of Bethel, their "},{"t":"confidence","s":["H4009"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":14,"text":"How can you say, We are mighty men And valiant men for war?","tok":[{"t":"How can you "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", We are "},{"t":"mighty","s":["H1368"],"a":[2]},{"t":" men And valiant "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[4]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"war","s":["H4421"],"a":[6]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":15,"text":"Moab has been destroyed, And its cities have gone up in smoke, And its choice young men have gone down to slaughter, Declares the King, whose name is Jehovah of hosts.","tok":[{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" has been destroyed, And its "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have gone "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in smoke, And its choice young "},{"t":"men","s":["H0970"],"a":[5]},{"t":" have gone "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"slaughter","s":["H2874"],"a":[7]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Declares","s":["H5002"],"a":[8]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"King","s":["H4428"],"a":[9]},{"t":", whose "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[12]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":16,"text":"The calamity of Moab is near to coming, And his affliction hastens quickly.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"calamity","s":["H0343"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"near","s":["H7138"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"coming","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And his "},{"t":"affliction","s":["H7451"],"a":[4]},{"t":" hastens quickly."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Lament for him, all who are around him And all who know his name; Say, How the strong rod is broken, The glorious staff.","tok":[{"t":"Lament for him, all who are around him And all who "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[5]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Say","s":["H0559"],"a":[7]},{"t":", How the "},{"t":"strong","s":["H5797"],"a":[11]},{"t":" "},{"t":"rod","s":["H4731"],"a":[12]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[9]},{"t":", The glorious "},{"t":"staff","s":["H4294"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"Come down from glory and sit in thirst, O daughter who dwells in Dibon, For the destroyer of Moab has come up against you; He has destroyed your strongholds.","tok":[{"t":"Come "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"sit","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"thirst","s":["H6772"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[5]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"dwells","s":["H3427"],"a":[2]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"Dibon","s":["H1769"],"a":[6]},{"t":", For the destroyer of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[9]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"come","s":["H5927"],"a":[10]},{"t":" up against you; He has "},{"t":"destroyed","s":["H7843"],"a":[12]},{"t":" your strongholds."}]},{"n":19,"text":"Stand by the way and watch, O inhabitant of Aroer; Ask him who flees and her who escapes, And say, What has happened?","tok":[{"t":"Stand","s":["H5975"],"a":[2]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"way","s":["H1870"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and watch, O "},{"t":"inhabitant","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Aroer","s":["H6177"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Ask","s":["H7592"],"a":[6]},{"t":" him who flees and her who "},{"t":"escapes","s":["H4422"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"say","s":["H0559"],"a":[9]},{"t":", What has happened?"}]},{"n":20,"text":"Moab is put to shame, for it is shattered. Howl and cry out; Declare by the Arnon That Moab is devastated.","tok":[{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is put to shame, for it is shattered. "},{"t":"Howl","s":["H3213"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"cry","s":["H2199"],"a":[5]},{"t":" out; Declare by the "},{"t":"Arnon","s":["H0769"],"a":[7]},{"t":" That "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[10]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"devastated","s":["H7703"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":21,"text":"And judgment has come upon the land of the Plateau, on Holon and on Jahzah and on Mephaath","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[0]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a