"},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; so "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"wallow","s":["H5606"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in his "},{"t":"vomit","s":["H6892"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and will also be in "},{"t":"derision","s":["H7814"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":27,"text":"For was not Israel a derision to you? Or was he found among thieves? For as often as you speak of him, you shake your head.","tok":[{"t":"For was not "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[5]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"derision","s":["H7814"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to you? Or was he "},{"t":"found","s":["H4672"],"a":[8]},{"t":" among "},{"t":"thieves","s":["H1590"],"a":[7]},{"t":"? For as often as you speak of him, you shake your head."}]},{"n":28,"text":"Leave the cities and dwell in the rock, O inhabitants of Moab, And be like a dove who nests On the sides of the mouth of the pit.","tok":[{"t":"Leave","s":["H5800"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"dwell","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"rock","s":["H5553"],"a":[3]},{"t":", O inhabitants of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And be like a "},{"t":"dove","s":["H3123"],"a":[7]},{"t":" who "},{"t":"nests","s":["H7077"],"a":[8]},{"t":" On the "},{"t":"sides","s":["H5676"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of the pit."}]},{"n":29,"text":"We have heard of the pride of Moab — He is extremely proud — Of his loftiness and his pride and his arrogance And of the haughtiness of his heart.","tok":[{"t":"We have "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[2]},{"t":" — He is extremely "},{"t":"proud","s":["H1343"],"a":[3]},{"t":" — Of his "},{"t":"loftiness","s":["H1363"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"his","s":["H1346"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and his arrogance And of the "},{"t":"haughtiness","s":["H7312"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":30,"text":"I know of his insolence, declares Jehovah; His boastings are all untrue; They have accomplished nothing.","tok":[{"t":"I "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of his insolence, declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; His boastings are all untrue; They have accomplished nothing."}]},{"n":31,"text":"Therefore I will wail for Moab, I will even cry out for all Moab; There will be mourning for the men of Kir-heres.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I will wail for "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":", I will even cry "},{"t":"out","s":["H2199"],"a":[7]},{"t":" for all "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; There will be "},{"t":"mourning","s":["H1897"],"a":[12]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Kir","s":["H7025"],"a":[10]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"heres","s":["H7025"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":32,"text":"With more than the weeping of Jazer I will weep for you, O vine of Sibmah. Your shoots have crossed over to the sea; They have reached as far as the sea, to Jazer; On your summer fruit and on your vintage The destroyer has fallen.","tok":[{"t":"With more than the "},{"t":"weeping","s":["H1065"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jazer","s":["H3270"],"a":[1]},{"t":" I will "},{"t":"weep","s":["H1058"],"a":[2]},{"t":" for you, O "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Sibmah","s":["H7643"],"a":[5]},{"t":". Your shoots have crossed "},{"t":"over","s":["H5674"],"a":[7]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; They have "},{"t":"reached","s":["H5060"],"a":[12]},{"t":" as far as the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[10]},{"t":", to "},{"t":"Jazer","s":["H3270"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; On your summer "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H7019"],"a":[14]},{"t":" and on your "},{"t":"vintage","s":["H1210"],"a":[16]},{"t":" The destroyer has "},{"t":"fallen","s":["H5307"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":33,"text":"Rejoicing and exultation are taken away From the fruited field and from the land of Moab. And I have caused the wine from the wine presses to cease; No one will tread them with the harvest shout; The harvest shout will be no harvest shout.","tok":[{"t":"Rejoicing and exultation are "},{"t":"taken","s":["H0622"],"a":[0]},{"t":" away From the fruited "},{"t":"field","s":["H3759"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and from the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[5]},{"t":". And I have caused the wine from the "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[6]},{"t":" presses to cease; No one will "},{"t":"tread","s":["H1869"],"a":[10]},{"t":" them with the harvest "},{"t":"shout","s":["H1959"],"a":[11]},{"t":"; The harvest "},{"t":"shout","s":["H1959"],"a":[12]},{"t":" will be no harvest "},{"t":"shout","s":["H1959"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":34,"text":"From the cry of Heshbon as far as Elealeh, even as far as Jahaz, they have uttered their voice, from Zoar as far as Horonaim and to Eglath-shelishiyah; for even the waters of Nimrim will become a devastation.","tok":[{"t":"From the "},{"t":"cry","s":["H2201"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Heshbon","s":["H2809"],"a":[1]},{"t":" as far as "},{"t":"Elealeh","s":["H0500"],"a":[3]},{"t":", even as far as "},{"t":"Jahaz","s":["H3096"],"a":[5]},{"t":", they have "},{"t":"uttered","s":["H5414"],"a":[6]},{"t":" their "},{"t":"voice","s":["H6963"],"a":[7]},{"t":", from "},{"t":"Zoar","s":["H6820"],"a":[8]},{"t":" as far as "},{"t":"Horonaim","s":["H2773"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and to Eglath-shelishiyah; for even the "},{"t":"waters","s":["H4325"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Nimrim","s":["H5249"],"a":[16]},{"t":" will become a devastation."}]},{"n":35,"text":"And I will bring to an end in Moab the one who offers up in high places and burns incense to his gods, declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"And I will bring to an end in "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the one who "},{"t":"offers","s":["H5927"],"a":[4]},{"t":" up in high "},{"t":"places","s":["H1116"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and burns "},{"t":"incense","s":["H6999"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to his "},{"t":"gods","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":", declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":36,"text":"Therefore My heart will moan for Moab like flutes; for the men of Kir-heres My heart will also moan like flutes. As a result, the abundance he has produced has perished.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore My "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will moan for "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":" like flutes; for the "},{"t":"men","s":["H0582"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Kir","s":["H7025"],"a":[9]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"heres","s":["H7025"],"a":[9]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will also moan like flutes. As a result, the abundance he has produced has "},{"t":"perished","s":["H0006"],"a":[17]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":37,"text":"For every head is bald, and every beard is shaved off; there are cuts on all the hands, and sackcloth on the loins.","tok":[{"t":"For every "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"bald","s":["H7144"],"a":[3]},{"t":", and every "},{"t":"beard","s":["H2206"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is shaved off; there are cuts on all the "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[9]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"sackcloth","s":["H8242"],"a":[13]},{"t":" on the "},{"t":"loins","s":["H4975"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":38,"text":"On all the roofs of Moab and in her open squares there is wailing everywhere, for I have broken Moab like a vessel which no one desires, declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"On all the roofs of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":" and in her open squares there is wailing everywhere, for I have "},{"t":"broken","s":["H7665"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[10]},{"t":" like a "},{"t":"vessel","s":["H3627"],"a":[11]},{"t":" which no one desires, declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":39,"text":"How it is shattered! they howl. How Moab has turned his back in shame! So Moab has become a derision and a terror to all who are around him.","tok":[{"t":"How it is shattered! they "},{"t":"howl","s":["H3213"],"a":[2]},{"t":". "},{"t":"How","s":["H2865"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[6]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"turned","s":["H6437"],"a":[4]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"back","s":["H6203"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"shame","s":["H0954"],"a":[7]},{"t":"! So "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[9]},{"t":" has become a "},{"t":"derision","s":["H7814"],"a":[10]},{"t":" and a terror to all who are around him."}]},{"n":40,"text":"For thus says Jehovah, One will swoop down like an eagle And spread its wings against Moab.","tok":[{"t":"For thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":", One will swoop down like an "},{"t":"eagle","s":["H5404"],"a":[5]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"spread","s":["H6566"],"a":[7]},{"t":" its "},{"t":"wings","s":["H3671"],"a":[8]},{"t":" against "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":41,"text":"Kerioth is captured, And the strongholds are seized, And the heart of the mighty men of Moab in that day Will be like the heart of a woman in labor.","tok":[{"t":"Kerioth","s":["H7152"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is captured, And the strongholds are seized, And the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of the mighty men of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in that "},{"t":"day","s":["H3117"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Will be like the "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3820"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of a "},{"t":"woman","s":["H0802"],"a":[11]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"labor","s":["H6887"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":42,"text":"And Moab will be destroyed from being a people, Because he magnified himself against Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will be "},{"t":"destroyed","s":["H8045"],"a":[0]},{"t":" from being a "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Because he "},{"t":"magnified","s":["H1431"],"a":[6]},{"t":" himself against "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":43,"text":"Dread, pit, and snare Are upon you, O inhabitant of Moab, Declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"Dread","s":["H6343"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"pit","s":["H6354"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"snare","s":["H6341"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Are upon you, O "},{"t":"inhabitant","s":["H3427"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[5]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Declares","s":["H5002"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":44,"text":"He who flees from dread Will fall into the pit, And he who comes up out of the pit Will be taken in the snare; For I will bring upon her, upon Moab, The year of their punishment, declares Jehovah.","tok":[{"t":"He who flees "},{"t":"from","s":["H6440"],"a":[1]},{"t":" dread Will "},{"t":"fall","s":["H5307"],"a":[3]},{"t":" into the "},{"t":"pit","s":["H6354"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And he who comes "},{"t":"up","s":["H5927"],"a":[6]},{"t":" out of the "},{"t":"pit","s":["H6354"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Will be "},{"t":"taken","s":["H3920"],"a":[9]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"snare","s":["H6341"],"a":[10]},{"t":"; For I will "},{"t":"bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[12]},{"t":" upon her, upon "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[15]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"year","s":["H8141"],"a":[16]},{"t":" of their punishment, declares "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[19]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":45,"text":"In the shadow of Heshbon Those who flee stand without strength; For fire has gone forth from Heshbon And a flame from the midst of Sihon; And it has consumed the corner of Moab And the top of the head of the sons of tumult.","tok":[{"t":"In the "},{"t":"shadow","s":["H6738"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Heshbon","s":["H2809"],"a":[1]},{"t":" Those who flee stand without strength; For "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[6]},{"t":" has gone "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3318"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Heshbon","s":["H2809"],"a":[8]},{"t":" And a "},{"t":"flame","s":["H3852"],"a":[9]},{"t":" from the "},{"t":"midst","s":["H099